    "head_branch": "fix/github-sync-one-issue-per-marker",
    "head_commit_message": "fix(ci): github-sync keeps one issue per marker\n\nSpec 40 step 4. Each run prints how many issues, PRs and sync markers it\nread before writing; before creating for a spec it also reads that spec's\nmilestone and counts the markers there as its own; where several issues\ncarry one marker the lowest-numbered is kept and each later open copy is\nclosed as a duplicate with a comment naming it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EeUJm2SEvg586DkCD1ifGW",
